---
import { site, productExternalUrl } from '../config/site';
---

<section id="productos" class="section-pad border-t border-border bg-surface">
  <div class="container-nexo">
    <div class="reveal grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.7fr] lg:items-end lg:gap-20" style="--index: 0">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Producto en operación</p>
        <h2 class="heading-display mt-4 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-medium sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.8rem]">
          Construir también nos obliga a resolver el detalle.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-lg text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted lg:justify-self-end">
        {site.product.name} nació de un proceso administrativo concreto: descargar muchas
        constancias sin cargar cada CUIT de forma manual.
      </p>
    </div>

    <article class="reveal mt-14 overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-border bg-canvas shadow-[0_24px_80px_rgba(17,24,32,0.08)]" style="--index: 1">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[0.78fr_1.22fr]">
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between border-b border-border p-7 sm:p-10 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r lg:p-12">
          <div>
            <span class="tag tag-green">Producto propio</span>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.05em] text-ink sm:text-5xl">{site.product.name}</h3>
            <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
              Subís un Excel, procesás el lote y descargás las constancias oficiales agrupadas
              en un archivo ZIP.
            </p>

            <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3" aria-label="Características principales">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-ink">
                <span class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-soft text-xs font-bold text-blue" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                Carga masiva desde Excel
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-ink">
                <span class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-soft text-xs font-bold text-blue" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                PDF oficial de AFIP
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-ink">
                <span class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-soft text-xs font-bold text-blue" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                Operación 100% web y sin clave fiscal
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a
            href={productExternalUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-primary mt-10 w-fit"
          >
            Conocer {site.product.name}
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-blue-soft p-4 sm:p-7 lg:p-10">
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-night text-white shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(13,21,28,0.22)]">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15"></span>
                <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15"></span>
                <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-lime"></span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-mono text-[0.58rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/65">Vista ilustrativa del producto</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 sm:p-7">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                  <p class="font-mono text-[0.64rem] uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-lime">Lote activo</p>
                  <h4 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">lote_cuits.xlsx</h4>
                </div>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-blue/50 bg-blue/20 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-white/80">En curso</span>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-7 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.045] p-5">
                <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
                  <div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-white/65">Constancias procesadas</p>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]">847 <span class="text-base font-normal text-white/60">/ 1.000</span></p>
                  </div>
                  <span class="font-mono text-xs text-lime">84,7%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-4 h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10">
                  <div class="h-full w-[84.7%] rounded-full bg-lime"></div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-3">
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-3 sm:p-4">
                  <p class="font-mono text-[0.58rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-white/60">Exitosas</p>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold sm:text-xl">812</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-3 sm:p-4">
                  <p class="font-mono text-[0.58rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-white/60">Pendientes</p>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold sm:text-xl">153</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-3 sm:p-4">
                  <p class="font-mono text-[0.58rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-white/60">Errores</p>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold sm:text-xl">35</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-4">
                <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue text-sm" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm font-medium">ZIP listo al finalizar</p>
                  <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-white/60">Todos los documentos en una descarga</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <ol class="mt-5 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3" aria-label="Flujo de constanci.ar">
            <li class="rounded-xl bg-white/65 p-3 text-xs font-medium text-ink"><span class="mr-2 font-mono text-blue">01</span> Subir Excel</li>
            <li class="rounded-xl bg-white/65 p-3 text-xs font-medium text-ink"><span class="mr-2 font-mono text-blue">02</span> Procesar lote</li>
            <li class="rounded-xl bg-white/65 p-3 text-xs font-medium text-ink"><span class="mr-2 font-mono text-blue">03</span> Descargar ZIP</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
